#. module: currency_rate_update_cz
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:currency_rate_update_cz.field_res_currency_rate_provider__cnb_rate_mode
msgid ""
"Daily: every ČNB fixing is stored and a document takes the rate of its day. Fixed monthly: one rate per month, dated the 1st, which Odoo then applies to the whole month (pevný kurz, § 24c odst. 2 and § 24d odst. 4 ZoÚ; for VAT the rate valid for the person converting on the tax point, § 4 odst. 8 ZDPH). The actual daily fixings are still kept, apart, for the balance-sheet revaluation, which must use the rate of that day (§ 24c odst. 1 písm. b) ZoÚ).\n"
"\n"
"Switching to monthly does not delete daily rates already stored; remove those for the months that should use the fixed rate."
msgstr ""

